 "notes": [
  "A first attempt integrated the archived mean yaw rate (psi_dot * L^2 / (2 vx)) and predicted 1.20 m for the same cell that measures 0.115 m: the mean rate carries the wobble, and the wobble cancels in the trajectory but not in the integral. Displacement has to be walked, not integrated.",
  "cross_median / cross_min / cross_max are the cross-track offset along the start heading's left axis, in metres, signed; heading_median_deg / heading_min_deg / heading_max_deg are the heading change wrapped to +-180 degrees.",
